Responsibilities:
- Support critical daily operation throughout T-Session and After-Hours Trading Session of the Derivatives Market to ensure smooth trading operations of the derivatives market by managing operational risks and promptly escalating issues;
- Ensure the trading activities are in compliance with the relevant regulations, rules and operational procedures;
- Provide excellent customer service in the context of Exchange Trading operations and maintain rapport relations with the various functions of Exchange Participants;
